-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",183,{
[5825]="7006B5A4\n1\tFind and defeat a glory-seeking Free Person\tFind a Free Person who is seeking glory across the Ettenmoors and slay them in the name of Angmar! Only Glory Seeking Free People Players count toward the advance of this quest.\n",
[5826]="7005294C\n1\tDefeat Gnartosk\tGnartosk can be found on the banks of the Anduin in Laerlad. You should defeat Gnartosk.\n2\tDefeat Gnartosk\tGnartosk can be found on the banks of the Anduin in Laerlad. You should defeat Gnartosk.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Gnartosk.\n",
[5827]="70028455\n1\tDefeat Isen Wargs (total: 12)\tWargs roam the western reaches of Nan Curunír. Ondor is concerned that, left unchecked, the Wargs will eventually converge on his location.\n2\tTalk to Ondor in Nan Curunír\tOndor is encamped near the caves in western Nan Curunír. You should tell Ondor that you have managed to defeat a fair number of the Isen Wargs.\n",
[5828]="7004A8E0\n1\tTalk to Legolas in the Tower of Cirith Ungol\tLegolas can be found in the turret of the Tower of Cirith Ungol. In order to allow Belzagar to deliver a message of warning to his masters, Legolas plans to distract Shelob's brood at the Under-gate to provide a means for Belzagar to escape Cirith Ungol. You should talk to Legolas when you are ready to travel to the Under-gate.\n2\tTalk to Legolas on the road to Cirith Ungol\tLegolas can be found beside the road to Cirith Ungol. You battled one of Shelob's greater children, Saernaston, but it appears the great spider was dragged to its doom by Shelob herself. You have fled the Tower of Cirith Ungol and must now hope that Belzagar delivered your warning to his masters, Ugrukhôr and Rûkhor.\n",
[5829]="70059776\n1\tDefeat wargs at the Gnawbone Pit\tFoes can be found at the Gnawbone Pit in the Wildwood. You should defeat wargs at the Gnawbone Pit.\n2\tDefeat wargs at the Gnawbone Pit (total: 6)\tFoes can be found at the Gnawbone Pit in the Wildwood. You should defeat wargs at the Gnawbone Pit.\n",
[5830]="7001B190\n1\tCollect clues to Hal's fate (total: 6)\tBlack dogs can be found throughout the Scuttledells. Ivorel has asked you to hunt down black dogs in the hopes of finding some clue -- or perhaps the remains -- of Hal Tiller.\n2\tTalk to Ivorel at her camp\tIvorel is at her camp in the Scuttledells. You should return to Ivorel and show her the remains that you have collected.\n",
[5831]="7005F6C6\n1\tDefeat Thrastring the Gluttonous in Ormgren\030Defeat gnawing glow-worms in Ormgren (total: 8)\tThrastring and gnawing glow-worms can be found in Ormgren. As some of the glow-worms of Ormgren have begun to gnaw at the mountain with a seemingly insatiable fervour, Lokur fears that the failure of the warding-runes has upset a delicate balance in Gloomingtarn. You should defeat Thrastring and the other gnawing glow-worms in Ormgren.\n2\tTalk to Lokur in Ormgren\tLokur can be found in Ormgren. You have defeated Thrastring and several of the gnawing glow-worms in Ormgren. You should return to Lokur.\n",
[5832]="7001757C\n1\tDefeat Nameless in the Foundations of Stone (total: 12)\tNameless can be found in the south-west reaches of the Foundations of Stone. Sadreda has asked you to prove your worth by defeating the Nameless.\n2\tTalk to Sadreda at the Shadowed Refuge\tSadreda is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone, north-west from the lairs of the Nameless there. You should return to Sadreda with news of your victory.\n",
[5833]="700088DC\n1\tDefeat Wintersebb Drake (total: 4)\030Defeat Wintersebb Drakeling (total: 4)\tWintersebb drakes and drakelings can be found throughout Arador's End. Gasham begged for your help against the Wintersebb drakes.\n2\tReturn to Gasham at Grothum\tGasham is in the goblin-village of Grothum. You hunted the drakes in the mountainous area of Arador's End and culled their number. You should return to Gasham with the news.\n",
[5834]="7000B8CF\n1\tDefeat overland guards (total: 6)\030Defeat overland stabbers (total: 6)\030Defeat overland bombers (total: 6)\tThe goblin-encampment is north-east of Eywind's camp, near the gates of Goblin-town. Eywind asked you to test the strength of the goblin-encampments which lie near the gates of Goblin-town.\n2\tTalk to Eywind\tYou should return to Eywind at Vindurhal in Northern High-pass and recount to him your battles against the Goblins.\n",
[5835]="70020BB0\n1\tTalk to a Ranger at Echad Idhrenfair\tThere are Rangers at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens. You should bring the spear you collected to the Rangers of the Grey Company. They may know more about the strange goblins.\n",
[5836]="700166E5\n1\tDefeat goblin-overseers (total: 3)\tGoblin-overseers can be found in and around the encampment Gazatmur. Slagvi told you that the goblin-overseers must be defeated if the goblin-encampment threatening the Dolven-view is to be destroyed.\n2\tReturn to Wigfast\tWigfast can be found at his hiding spot near Gazatmur in the Great Delving. You should return to Wigfast and inform him that the goblins' overseers have been defeated.\n",
[5837]="7001BBAB\n1\tDefeat Lûz\tSeek out the goblin, Lûz, at the goblin-camps north-east of The Forsaken Inn. Lieva Dourlily told you to be wary of the goblin pack-master, Lûz, and requested that you defeat him if you find him.\n2\tTalk to Lieva Dourlilly at The Forsaken Inn\tLieva Dourlily is at The Forsaken Inn, south-west of the goblin-camps. You found and defeated the goblin pack-master Lûz. Now you only need to return to Lieva Dourlily.\n",
[5838]="700529ED\n1\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Langhár.\n2\tTalk to Skalla\tSkalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Skalla.\n3\tTalk to the Beorning near the Old Ford\030Talk to the Beorning south of Vegbár\030Talk to Hertha at the High Pass\tSkalla has asked you to speak to the others around Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes. You should speak to the other Beornings around Vegbár.\n4\tTalk to Skalla\tSkalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Skalla.\n5\tTravel to Ainhard's Homestead\tAinhard's homestead lies somewhere south of Vegbár in the Wolf-denes. You should travel to Ainhard's homestead.\n6\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n7\tTalk to Ainhard\tAinhard's homestead lies south of Vegbár in the Wolf-denes. You should travel to Ainhard's homestead.\n",
[5839]="70037153\n1\tDefeat Natul\tYou should hunt down and defeat the goblin-captain whose badge you recovered.\n2\tDefeat Natul\tNatul roams the fields south of Torsbury. You should hunt down and defeat the goblin-captain whose badge you recovered.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have tracked and slain Natul, a goblin-captain of the Broadacres.\n",
[5840]="7000005C\n1\tDefeat goblins in the Lone-lands (total: 10)\tGoblins can be found in Annunlos north and east from The Forsaken Inn. Anlaf the Forlorn, proprietor of The Forsaken Inn, suggested that you might be the solution to his goblin-problem. He has asked that you show the goblins of Annunlos that they are not welcome in the Lone-lands.\n2\tTalk to Anlaf the Forlorn at The Forsaken Inn\tAnlaf the Forlorn resides at The Forsaken Inn along the Great East Road. Anlaf may be pleased to learn that you have slain a good number of the goblins that trouble him.\n",
[5841]="7000B8D0\n1\tCollect goblin fire-pots (total: 5)\tEywind believes that the goblins' fire-pots can be used against them to burn down their camps. He has sent you into their camp to steal a number of them for him to examine.\n2\tBring the goblin fire-pots to Eywind near the entrance to the High Pass\tThe goblin-encampments are north-east of Eywind's camp, near the gates of Goblin-town. Eywind asked you to steal fire-pots from the encampments on the slopes and ridges near the gates of Goblin-town and bring them to him.\n",
[5842]="7001AA79\n1\tDefeat goblin-spies (total: 4)\tGoblin-spies can be found in the forests east and north of Ost Galadh. Lomdognir has sent you to hunt down the goblin-spies.\n2\tTalk to Lomdognir at Ost Galadh\tLomdognir is at Ost Galadh. You should return to Lomgodnir with news of your success.\n",
[5843]="7000A293\n1\tThe goblin-camp is at the Bleakleaf Crest, south of Dwaling. Bob Greeneaves has asked you to find the corpse of the spider the goblins dragged off, in hopes that you might learn something important about the goblins.\t\n2\tTalk to Bob Greeneaves in Dwaling\tBob Greeneaves is at Dwaling, north of the Bleakleaf Crest. You should return to Bob Greeneaves with the information you discovered.\n",
[5844]="7000C37B\n1\tDefeat goblins in and around Goblin-town (total: 12)\030Discover the main gate into Goblin-town\tThe main gate into Goblin-town is to the north and east of Glóin's camp. Glóin has instructed you to enter the main gate into Goblin-town and defeat many of the Overland Goblins near the entrance.\n2\tTalk to Glóin at his camp outside Goblin-town\tGlóin is at his camp, just outside the entrance of Goblin-town. Goblin-town teemed with goblins, and the forces within were ferocious and many. You steeled your nerve and struck against them, felling many as you pressed through the entrance of their terrible kingdom. Now you should return to Glóin with news of your success.\n",
[5845]="70061772\n1\tDefeat goblins at Bâr Faroth (total: 14)\tGoblins can be found at Bâr Faroth in Yondershire. While exploring the Yondershire, you have encountered goblins at Bâr Faroth. You should defeat goblins at Bâr Faroth.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many goblins at Bâr Faroth.\n",
[5846]="70025B73\n1\tDefeat goblins at Tham Andalath (total: 12)\tTham Andalath is north east of Tinnudir and east of Tham Ornen. Brogdagnir asked you to venture to Tham Andalath and defeat many of the goblins encamped there.\n2\tTalk to Brogdagnir\tBrogdagnir is at Tinnudir, south west of Tham Andalath. Brogdagnir will be pleased to hear the goblins at Tham Andalath have been defeated.\n",
[5847]="70062D88\n1\tDefeat goblins (total: 12)\tTaeras has asked you to clear the tombs of Haudh Narui of goblins. Haudh Narui is located in north-eastern Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Taeras\tYou should let Taeras know that you have defeated goblins in Haudh Narui. Taeras is at Scurloc Farm.\n",
[5848]="700529D4\n1\tTalk to Langhár\tAinhard's homestead lies south of Vegbár. in the Wolf-denes. You should talk to Langhár at Ainhard's homestead.\n2\tReturn to the goblin tracks\tThe goblin tracks begin outside Ainhard's homestead. You should return to the start of the goblins' trail.\n3\tFollow the goblin tracks with Langhár\tThe goblin tracks begin outside Ainhard's homestead. You should follow the goblins' trail with Langhár.\n4\tFollow the goblin tracks with Langhár\tThe goblin tracks begin outside Ainhard's homestead. You should follow the goblins' trail with Langhár.\n5\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár can be summoned to your side with Langhár's summoning horn. You should talk to Langhár.\n6\tTalk to Langhár and continue the search\tYou and Langhár have discovered goblins occupying the Woodmen village of Waldfast. You should complete 'Instance: The Great Goblin in Exile.'\n7\tTalk to Langhár\tLanghár is outside the village of Waldfast. You should talk to Langhár.\n8\tTalk to Skalla\tSkalla can be found in Vegbár, the Beorning outpost in northern Wolf-denes. You should talk to Skalla.\n",
[5849]="7006688E\n1\tDefeat goblins in Pinnath Gelin (total: 12)\tLúmar has asked you to lessen the number of goblins present in Pinnath Gelin. You should look for goblins north of Iáphel, in Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tSpeak to Lúmar in Ost Arndír\tYou have dealt a blow to the goblins in Pinnath Gellin. You should let Lúmar know that you lessened the threat you found. Lúmar is in Ost Arndír.\n",
[5850]="7000A2AA\n1\tDefeat goblins at Tûm Fuin (total: 12)\tGoblins have made a camp at Tûm Fuin, north of Ost Forod in Tyrn Fornech. Poppy Seaton has asked you to do something about the goblins that have taken up residence at Tûm Fuin.\n2\tTalk to Poppy Seaton\tPoppy Seaton is at Ost Forod, the old watch-post in the hills of Tyrn Fornech, south of Tûm Fuin. You have defeated many goblins and should now return to Poppy with news of your victory.\n",
[5851]="70007F4D\n1\tBring the goblin fetish to Bolli\tBolli is at Gondamon, east of Noglond. Grímkell has asked you to take the goblin fetish to Bolli, the Captain of the Guard at Gondamon, and warn him of the threat the goblins pose.\n",
[5852]="7000729E\n1\tDefeat Gazrîp\tGazrîp can be found beyond the barricade south of Ingólfr's camp deep within the goblin camps. Ingólfr has asked you to enter Rath Teraig and deal with the goblin-leader Gazrîp, in hopes that his death will teach the goblins to keep away from the barricades long enough for the winter snows to fill the pass.\n2\tTalk to Ingólfr\tIngólfr is at his camp beyond the barricade at the northern entrance to Rath Teraig. You should return to Ingólfr and tell him of your battles against the goblin-leader in Rath Teraig.\n",
[5853]="7001ABA3\n1\tDefeat goblins (total: 8)\tGoblins can be found at Draugdegil, north of Helethir and just inside the gate and Fennas Guldur.\n",
[5854]="70020DA7\n1\tReturn to the gate of the goblin-village\tThe gate to the goblin-village lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair. Idhrenfair has asked you to scout the goblin-village you discovered while patrolling the Gloomglens to determine its strength and to whom its inhabitants owe allegiance.\n2\tGo to the second patrol point\tThe goblin-village lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue deeper into the goblin-village.\n3\tGo to the third patrol point\tThe goblin-village lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue deeper into the goblin-village.\n4\tGo to the fourth patrol point\tThe goblin-village lies to the south-east of Echad Idhrenfair. You should continue deeper into the goblin-village.\n5\tTalk to Idhrenfair at Echad Idhrenfair\tIdhrenfair is at Echad Idhrenfair, north-west of the goblin-village. You should return to Idhrenfair with tidings of what you have learned.\n",
[5855]="70062D22\n1\tLook for Innathron\tGwendrian has asked you to look for her companion in Gwâl Cruban. Gwâl Cruban is in northern Swanfleet.\n2\tYou should try to free Innathron's foot\tYou found Innathron in Gwâl Cruban, however, he has managed to get his foot stuck in a small sink hole. You should try to free Innathron.\n3\tSpeak to Innathron\tInnathron is waiting to thank you for freeing him. Innathron is in Gwâl Cruban, in northern Swanfleet.\n",
[5856]="70026C69\n1\tFind Melilot's missing porridge\030Find Melilot's missing cheeses\030Find Melilot's missing bread\030Find Melilot's missing eggs\030Find Melilot's missing mushrooms\tMelilot's missing things can be found not far from the Party Tree. She has given you a note with some record of where her day led her. You should collect Melilot's missing items, using the note to guess at probable locations for the lost goods.\n2\tBring the food to Melilot Hayward\tMelilot Hayward is waiting for you at the Party Tree, probably very hungry (which might explain why she couldn't figure out where she left all of her food). You should bring Melilot's picnic items back to her.\n",
})
